<title>UK: Delays of 2-3 days on Norway Gullfaks A crude-trad.</title>
<headline>Delays of 2-3 days on Norway Gullfaks A crude-trad.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Norwegian Gullfaks A crude oil will experience delays of 2-3 days from Tuesday due to problems at the new Vigdis field, trade sources said.</p>
<p>The Vigdis field, which is operated by Saga Petroleum, has been experiencing some flow problems for a few days and Gullfaks operators, Statoil decided on Tuesday to delay Gullfaks A loadings for 2-3 days as a result, sources said.</p>
<p>Saga operates the Vigdis field which feeds into the Gullfaks A crude stream. Loadings of Gullfaks C will not be affected.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
